WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.455
Okay, why do I only put this on at three
in the morning?

00:00:03.455 --> 00:00:06.724
Because I work nights, and this is my
actual bedtime.

00:00:06.724 --> 00:00:10.179
Everyone says night routine like everyone
sleeps at ten.

00:00:10.179 --> 00:00:15.360
If your schedule is weird, your routine
just has to match your sleep, not the
clock.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.987
I use the serum, wait ninety seconds, then
a thick cream on top to seal it.

00:00:19.987 --> 00:00:23.380
That's it. Link is in my bio if you want
the exact one.
